  <content contentuid="h12735b96gb271g4d6egbd1egd5844013a477" version="1">Lash out with a pseudopod for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;, additionally dealing &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;. A foe already coated in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acid&lt;/LSTag&gt; takes an &lt;b&gt;additional&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
