  <content contentuid="hb42d0cd0g555dg491aga5a7g5c9c96a509e2" version="1">Acid Brood</content>
  <content contentuid="h04179020g6951g43a6g86f1ge268f4fd7df7" version="1">The first time you coat a foe in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acid&lt;/LSTag&gt; each combat, you summon an &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Acid Spawn&lt;/LSTag&gt; that fights on its own. It grows and gains mutations as you fight amid acid — bathing in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;Acid&lt;/LSTag&gt; surfaces and slaying acid-coated foes. The brood dissolves when combat ends.</content>
  <content contentuid="he0c0fb16gd671g44edga410g23de5975a0f5" version="1">Vectors of Decay</content>
  <content contentuid="haa73f210g2ec5g494fg8fdag3d8c63054150" version="1">Foes struck by your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Acid Spawn&lt;/LSTag&gt; lose &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;AC&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="hf8e38740g977bg47d6g9c87g2c03fc34eccc" version="1">Solvent Heredity</content>
