  <content contentuid="hf94c4abcg1cacg4a73ga750ga8b562c4ed93" version="1">Your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;Acid Spawn&lt;/LSTag&gt; regain &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; at the start of their turn while standing in &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;acid&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
